license: MIT
version: "17.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
abstract: "A telescope-agnostic, format-agnostic HDF5 spectral data pipeline for radio astronomy,
  integrating observations from professional radio telescopes (FAST, Effelsberg, SALSA, SRT,
  Parkes, GBT, MeerKAT and others) into a unified FRO HDF5 v17 format for scientific analysis."
